- **`fuel_efficiency_rating`, `emission_standard`:** Qualitative ratings and standards can be enriched to analyze and compare compliance and efficiency.
- **`score_description`, `calculation_method`:** Descriptions and methods for scores are useful for understanding how scores were derived and their implications.
- **`user_name`, `email`, `role`, `organization`:** User-related information can be semantically analyzed for user behavior and organizational insights.
- **`modification_type`, `comments`:** Logs and comments provide context for changes and can be enriched for better understanding and audit trails.
